{
  "id": "216",
  "title": "Character Riddles",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-11-27",
  "synopsis": "Can you guess the answer to these Chinese character riddles?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/282/7acd6087b5239cc4b84d8d5b59a10a993e316e34.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "猜字谜\n\n    十张口，一颗心。\n    这是一个字谜。你能猜出这是一个什么字吗？\n    谜底是“思”字。“十张口”，说的是“思”的上半部分—“田”。把“田”分开来看，里面是一个“十”字，外面是一个“口”字，所以就是“十张口”。而“一颗心”说的就是“思”的下半部分—“心”。两个部分加起来就是“思”字了。\n    中国不但有谜语，还有字谜。字谜一般都比较短，谜底一般是一个字。像这样的字谜还有许多。比如“一人”、“山上还有山”、“点点成金”……这些都是字谜。你能猜出这三个字谜的谜底吗？\n    谜底分别是“大”、“出”、“全”。你猜对了吗？",
    "traditional": "猜字謎\n\n    十張口，一顆心。\n    這是一個字謎。你能猜出這是一個什麼字嗎？\n    謎底是“思”字。“十張口”，說的是“思”的上半部分—“田”。把“田”分開來看，裡面是一個“十”字，外面是一個“口”字，所以就是“十張口”。而“一顆心”說的就是“思”的下半部分—“心”。兩個部分加起來就是“思”字了。\n    中國不但有謎語，還有字謎。字謎一般都比較短，謎底一般是一個字。像這樣的字謎還有許多。比如“一人”、“山上還有山”、“點點成金”……這些都是字謎。你能猜出這三個字謎的謎底嗎？\n    謎底分別是“大”、“出”、“全”。你猜對了嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Guessing Character Riddles"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "十张口，一颗心。",
      "traditional": "十張口，一顆心。",
      "pinyin": "shí zhāng kǒu yì kē xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ten Mouths, One Heart"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "这是一个字谜。",
      "traditional": "這是一個字謎。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yí ge zì mí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "你能猜出这是一个什么字吗？",
      "traditional": "你能猜出這是一個什麼字嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ néng cāi chū zhè shì yí ge shén me zì ma",
      "english": "This is a character riddle."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can you guess what character it is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "谜底是“思”字。",
      "traditional": "謎底是“思”字。",
      "pinyin": "mí dǐ shì sī zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“十张口”，说的是“思”的上半部分—“田”。",
      "traditional": "“十張口”，說的是“思”的上半部分—“田”。",
      "pinyin": "shí zhāng kǒu shuō de shì sī de shàng bàn bù fen tián",
      "english": "The answer is “sī”."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "把“田”分开来看，里面是一个“十”字，外面是一个“口”字，",
      "traditional": "把“田”分開來看，裡面是一個“十”字，外面是一個“口”字，",
      "pinyin": "bǎ tián fēn kāi lái kàn lǐ miàn shì yí ge shí zì wài miàn shì yí ge kǒu zì",
      "english": "“Ten mouths” refers to the top part of “sī”: “tián”."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "所以就是“十张口”。",
      "traditional": "所以就是“十張口”。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ jiù shì shí zhāng kǒu",
      "english": "If you take “tián” apart and look, you find that it has a “shí” character on the inside, and “kǒu” on the outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "而“一颗心”说的就是“思”的下半部分—“心”。",
      "traditional": "而“一顆心”說的就是“思”的下半部分—“心”。",
      "pinyin": "ér yì kē xīn shuō de jiù shì sī de xià bàn bù fen xīn",
      "english": "So it's “ten mouths”."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "两个部分加起来就是“思”字了。",
      "traditional": "兩個部分加起來就是“思”字了。",
      "pinyin": "liǎng ge bù fen jiā qǐ lái jiù shì sī zì le",
      "english": "And “one heart” refers to the “xīn” at the bottom part of “sī”."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you put these two parts together you get the character “sī”."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "中国不但有谜语，还有字谜。",
      "traditional": "中國不但有謎語，還有字謎。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó bú dàn yǒu mí yǔ hái yǒu zì mí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "字谜一般都比较短，谜底一般是一个字。",
      "traditional": "字謎一般都比較短，謎底一般是一個字。",
      "pinyin": "zì mí yì bān dōu bǐ jiào duǎn mí dǐ yì bān shì yí ge zì",
      "english": "China does not just have riddles, but also has character riddles."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "像这样的字谜还有许多。",
      "traditional": "像這樣的字謎還有許多。",
      "pinyin": "xiàng zhè yàng de zì mí hái yǒu xǔ duō",
      "english": "Character riddles are usually quite short, and the answer is a character."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "比如“一人”、“山上还有山”、“点点成金”……",
      "traditional": "比如“一人”、“山上還有山”、“點點成金”……",
      "pinyin": "bǐ rú yì rén shān shang hái yǒu shān diǎn diǎn chéng jīn",
      "english": "There are many character riddles like this"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "这些都是字谜。",
      "traditional": "這些都是字謎。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē dōu shì zì mí",
      "english": "For example “one person”, “mountain on top of a mountain”, “a touch that turns things into gold” ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "你能猜出这三个字谜的谜底吗？",
      "traditional": "你能猜出這三個字謎的謎底嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ néng cāi chū zhè sān ge zì mí de mí dǐ ma",
      "english": "These are all character riddles."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can you guess the answers to these three character riddles?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "谜底分别是“大”、“出”、“全”。",
      "traditional": "謎底分別是“大”、“出”、“全”。",
      "pinyin": "mí dǐ fēn bié shì dà chū quán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "你猜对了吗？",
      "traditional": "你猜對了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ cāi duì le ma",
      "english": "The answers are, in order: “dà”, “chū”, “quán”."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
