    "sentence_translations": [
      "Guessing Character Riddles",
      "",
      "Ten Mouths, One Heart",
      "",
      "This is a character riddle.",
      "Can you guess what character it is?",
      "",
      "The answer is “sī”.",
      "“Ten mouths” refers to the top part of “sī”: “tián”.",
      "If you take “tián” apart and look, you find that it has a “shí” character on the inside, and “kǒu” on the outside.",
      "So it's “ten mouths”.",
      "And “one heart” refers to the “xīn” at the bottom part of “sī”.",
      "If you put these two parts together you get the character “sī”.",
      "",
      "China does not just have riddles, but also has character riddles.",
      "Character riddles are usually quite short, and the answer is a character.",
      "There are many character riddles like this",
      "For example “one person”, “mountain on top of a mountain”, “a touch that turns things into gold” ...",
      "These are all character riddles.",
      "Can you guess the answers to these three character riddles?",
      "",
      "The answers are, in order: “dà”, “chū”, “quán”.",
      "Did you guess right?",
      ""
    ]
  }
